{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29171","headline":"赠桐庐房明府先辈 · 许浑","name":"赠桐庐房明府先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝城春榜谪灵仙，四海声华二十年。\n阙下书功无後辈，卷中文字掩前贤。\n官闲每喜江山静，道在宁忧雨露偏。\n自笑小儒非一鹗，亦趋门屏冀相怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}